---
title: "Sequence: Claim Posted Shift (UC-05)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Employee
    participant SW as :SwapController
    participant Repo as :SqliteRepository
    participant RE as :RuleEngine
    participant SR as :SwapRequest
    participant Sh as :Shift
    Employee->>SW: claim(swapId, employeeId)
    SW->>Repo: swaps(), currentPeriod()
    Repo-->>SW: swap, shift
    SW->>+RE: validateAssignment(shift, employeeId, period, repo)
    RE-->>-SW: result
    alt no blocking violation
        SW->>SR: claimedBy = employeeId, status = claimed
        SW->>Sh: status = claimed
        SW->>Repo: transaction(saveSwap, saveShift)
        SW-->>Employee: claimed, waiting on the manager
    else blocking violation
        SW-->>Employee: refused with the failing rule
    end
    Note over SW,Sh: the check runs first,<br/>so a refused claim never writes anything
